<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us - Our Cafe</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=Playfair+Display:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.2/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
    <style>
          * {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

:root {
    --brown: #6a4034;
    --dark-brown: #40251f;
    --cream: #f8f5f0;
    --white: #ffffff;
}

body {
    font-family: "DM Sans", sans-serif;
    color: var(--white);
}

.hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    position: relative;
    background:
        linear-gradient(
            90deg,
            rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.78) 0%,
            rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.65) 42%,
            rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.28) 100%
        ),
        url("img-1.png") center center / cover no-repeat;
}

.top-bar {
    height: 50px;
    padding: 0 13%;
    background: #5a352b;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 9px;
}

.top-left {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
}

.top-left i {
    font-size: 16px;
}
.top-left span{
    font-size: 12px;;
}
.social-icons {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 15px;

}
.social-icons i{
    font-size: 16px;
}

.social-icons a,
.top-right a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

.social-icons a:hover,
.top-right a:hover {
    color: #d5a48d;
}

.top-right {
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 17px;
}
.top-right i{
    font-size: 14px;
}
.login-top {
    height: 100%;
    padding: 0 24px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    background: #3d241e;
    font-size: 14px;
}

.navbar {
    height: 67px;
    padding: 0 13%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
}

.logo {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: 23px;
    font-weight: 600;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

.logo > span:last-child {
    color: #c18c70;
}

.logo-icon {
    color: var(--brown);
    font-size: 20px;
}

.nav-links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 28px;
    list-style: none;
}

.nav-links a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: 16px;
    transition: 0.3s;
}

.nav-links a:hover,
.nav-links a.active {
    color: #c99378;
}

.nav-contact {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
    font-size: 12px;
    white-space: nowrap;
}

.nav-contact i {
    font-size: 16px;
}
.nav-contact span{
    font-size: 16px;
    font-family: sans-serif;
}
.menu-btn {
    display: none;
    border: none;
    background: transparent;
    color: white;
    font-size: 22px;
    cursor: pointer;
}

        
        .about-section {
            background: #f8f5f0;
            color: #3d241e;
            padding: 80px 13%;
            min-height: 80vh;
        }
        .about-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 50px;
            align-items: center;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }
        .about-img {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(61, 36, 30, 0.15);
            object-fit: cover;
            max-height: 450px;
        }
        .about-title {
            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
            font-size: 42px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #3d241e;
        }
        .about-text {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #684035;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }
        .features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .feature-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #ded8d3;
        }
        .feature-card i {
            color: #684035;
            font-size: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .feature-card h4 {
            font-family: "Playfair Display", serif;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .feature-card p {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #777;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="top-bar">
        <div class="top-left">
            <span><i class="fa-solid fa-clock"></i> Mon - Fri: 9:00 - 19:00 / Closed on Weekends</span>
        </div>
        <div class="social-icons">
            <a href="https://facebook.com" target="_blank"><i class="fa-brands fa-facebook-f"></i></a>
            <a href="https://instagram.com" target="_blank"><i class="fa-brands fa-instagram"></i></a>
            <a href="https://twitter.com" target="_blank"><i class="fa-brands fa-x-twitter"></i></a>
            <a href="https://youtube.com" target="_blank"><i class="fa-brands fa-youtube"></i></a>
        </div>
        <div class="top-right">
            <a href="/menu" title="Cart / Menu"><i class="fa-solid fa-cart-shopping"></i></a>
            <a href="/profile" title="Profile"><i class="fa-regular fa-user"></i></a>
            <a href="/login" class="login-top">LOGIN OR SIGN UP</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <nav class="navbar" style="background:#3d241e; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);">
        <a href="/index" class="logo" style="color:white;">
            <span class="logo-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-mug-hot"></i></span> Our Cafe
        </a>
        <ul class="nav-links">
            <li><a href="/index">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="/about" class="active">About</a></li>
            <li><a href="/menu">Menu</a></li>
            <li><a href="/tables">Book Table</a></li>
            <li><a href="/order-status">Order Status</a></li>
            <li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="nav-contact" style="color:white;">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-phone-volume"></i><a href="tel:+917052101786" style="text-decoration: none; color: white;"> <span type="tel" for="+91 705 210-1786">+91 705 210-1786</span></a>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <section class="about-section">
        <p class="subtitle" style="color:#684035; font-family:'Playfair Display', serif; font-weight:600;">OUR STORY</p>
        <h1 class="about-title">Crafting Perfect Coffee Moments Since 2018</h1>
        
        <div class="about-grid">
            <div>
                <p class="about-text">
                    At Our Cafe, we believe every cup of coffee tells a story. From ethically sourced beans from small-scale farmers to masterfully crafted espresso beverages, our mission is to deliver warmth, comfort, and extraordinary taste in every mug.
                </p>
                <p class="about-text">
                    Whether you are grabbing a quick morning flat white, working remotely at our cozy tables, or dining with loved ones, our smart digital ordering system ensures a fast, seamless experience.
                </p>
                <div class="features">
                    <div class="feature-card">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-seedling"></i>
                        <h4>100% Organic Beans</h4>
                        <p>Sourced directly from sustainable farms worldwide.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="feature-card">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bell-concierge"></i>
                        <h4>Smart Table Order</h4>
                        <p>Order & pay directly from your phone at any table.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div>
                <img src="img-1.png" alt="Cafe Interior" class="about-img">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</body>
</html>
